{"n": 652, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "652.webp", "text": "r,\n\n739 34197\n\n~\n\nee\n\n?\n\n28 34083\n\n34-11\n\n3431012 OVERHAULING BRAKE\nMASTER CYLINDER\n\nRemove master cylinder 34 31 000.\n\nNo replacement parts are available for brake\nmaster cylinders with a recessed stop pin\n(ABS).\n\nImportant!\n\nUse repair kit:\n\n(1) spring, (2) support ring, (3) primary cup,\n(4) filler ring, (5) intermediate piston,\n\n(6) separating cup, (7) stop sleeve, (8) spring,\n(9) screw, (10) push rod piston, (11) stop\nwasher, (12) secondary cup, (13) plastic\nsleeve, (14) circlip, (15) seal, (16) aluminum\nseal and (17) silicone grease.\n\nApply light pressure on push rod piston (10),\nlift out circlip (14) and unscrew stop screw\n(18).\n\nRelease push rod piston (10) slowly and pull\nit out.\n\nRemove intermediate piston by knocking\nhousing lightly on a piece of wood.\n\nClean cylinder housing and other parts not\nincluded in the repair kit with alcohol and\ndry with compressed air.\n\nTandem brake master cylinders with surface\ndamage in the cylinder bore may not be\nreused,\n\nCheck that all connecting, compensating and\nafter-tunning bores are clean.\n\n12\n\n3 15 [Ty\n14 16\n\n28 34085\n\nXS\n°o8\n>) S)\n4\nEH mag —\n4 cece\noO. ~\n26 34 087\n\nelpedi.<— _\n\nlom-m Fe\n\nOs 8\n18\n\n2834 ORR\n\nGive cylinder bore a very thin coat of ATE\nbrake cylinder paste.\n\nRemove large plug from assembly sleeve.\nSlide short neck part on to long neck pipe\nfar enough that stop washer (11), secondary\ncup (12), plastic sleeve (13), circlip (14),\nseal (15), aluminum seal (16) and silicone\ngrease (17) can be removed.\n\nRemove small plug.\n\nClamp cylinder housing in a vise fitted with\nsoft (aluminum) jaws.\n\nGuide assembly sleeve with long neck pipe\ninto cylinder bore.\n\nSlide stepped short neck pipe into cylinder\nbore against shoulder and hold in this position,\n\nPress contents of assembly sleeve into cylinder\nbore carefully with a suitable mandrel, until\nthe intermediate piston touches bottom of\nthe cylinder.", "words": [["r,", 0.0643, 0.9655, 0.0714, 0.9761], ["739", 0.1945, 0.2772, 0.2097, 0.2858], ["34197", 0.2138, 0.2759, 0.2411, 0.2851], ["~", 0.117, 0.8687, 0.1241, 0.8813], ["ee", 0.076, 0.8793, 0.1505, 0.9231], ["?", 0.153, 0.8912, 0.1575, 0.9012], ["28", 0.2006, 0.9775, 0.2107, 0.9847], ["34083", 0.2148, 0.9768, 0.2432, 0.9841], ["34-11", 0.4671, 0.0351, 0.5258, 0.0564], ["3431012", 0.2604, 0.0643, 0.31, 0.0756], ["OVERHAULING", 0.3227, 0.065, 0.4058, 0.0763], ["BRAKE", 0.4093, 0.065, 0.4473, 0.0763], ["MASTER", 0.3227, 0.0809, 0.3678, 0.0922], ["CYLINDER", 0.3713, 0.0809, 0.4286, 0.0922], ["Remove", 0.2609, 0.1134, 0.2994, 0.1247], ["master", 0.3029, 0.1154, 0.3343, 0.1247], ["cylinder", 0.3374, 0.1134, 0.3759, 0.1267], ["34", 0.3799, 0.1134, 0.3916, 0.1247], ["31", 0.3951, 0.1134, 0.4058, 0.1247], ["000.", 0.4103, 0.1134, 0.4311, 0.1253], ["No", 0.2609, 0.1293, 0.2751, 0.1406], ["replacement", 0.2781, 0.13, 0.3364, 0.1426], ["parts", 0.3399, 0.1313, 0.3627, 0.1432], ["are", 0.3663, 0.1326, 0.3804, 0.1412], ["available", 0.3835, 0.13, 0.4245, 0.1412], ["for", 0.4276, 0.13, 0.4417, 0.1412], ["brake", 0.4448, 0.1306, 0.4716, 0.1412], ["master", 0.2604, 0.1472, 0.2918, 0.1572], ["cylinders", 0.2953, 0.1459, 0.3384, 0.1592], ["with", 0.3419, 0.1459, 0.3627, 0.1572], ["a", 0.3663, 0.1485, 0.3713, 0.1565], ["recessed", 0.3749, 0.1466, 0.4134, 0.1572], ["stop", 0.4164, 0.1479, 0.4367, 0.1592], ["pin", 0.4397, 0.1466, 0.4549, 0.1592], ["(ABS).", 0.2609, 0.1611, 0.2928, 0.1737], ["Important!", 0.2604, 0.2958, 0.3136, 0.3077], ["Use", 0.2604, 0.3117, 0.2776, 0.3223], ["repair", 0.2806, 0.3117, 0.308, 0.3243], ["kit:", 0.3121, 0.3117, 0.3288, 0.3223], ["(1)", 0.2609, 0.3269, 0.2736, 0.3395], ["spring,", 0.2776, 0.3276, 0.3095, 0.3408], ["(2)", 0.3136, 0.3269, 0.3267, 0.3395], ["support", 0.3303, 0.3296, 0.3668, 0.3408], ["ring,", 0.3703, 0.3276, 0.3911, 0.3408], ["(3)", 0.3951, 0.3276, 0.4083, 0.3395], ["primary", 0.4124, 0.3282